{"html":"<p>Almost every React app loads data from an API. A first version takes five lines. A correct one handles three more things: showing a loading state, showing errors, and ignoring answers that arrive too late. Here&#39;s the version to start from.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-basic-pattern\">The Basic Pattern</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> UserCard</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setUser</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">error</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setError</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">loading</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setLoading</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> controller</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    setLoading</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    setError</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    fetch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">`/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, { signal: controller.signal })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">then</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">response</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">!</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">response.ok) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">`HTTP ${</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">response</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">status</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">json</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">then</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">data</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> setUser</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(data))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">err</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (err.name </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"AbortError\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">setError</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(err.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">!</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">controller.signal.aborted) </span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">setLoading</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> controller.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  }, [userId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (loading) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Loading…&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (error) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>Couldn't load the user: </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">{</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">error</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">></span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">{</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">user.name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">}</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#7EE787\">p</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Let&#39;s go through why each part is there.</p>\n<h2 id=\"loading-and-error-states\">Loading and Error States</h2>\n<p>Data takes time, and requests fail. Every fetch has three states to show:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>loading:</strong> a spinner or skeleton, so the page doesn&#39;t look broken,</li>\n<li><strong>error:</strong> a clear message, ideally with a way to retry,</li>\n<li><strong>success:</strong> the data.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The <code>role=&quot;alert&quot;</code> makes screen readers announce the error.</p>\n<h2 id=\"check-response-ok\">Check response.ok</h2>\n<p><code>fetch</code> only rejects when the network fails. A <strong>404 or 500 still resolves</strong>, so without the <code>response.ok</code> check, you&#39;d try to show an error page&#39;s JSON as a user. Throw on bad statuses so they land in <code>catch</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"race-conditions\">Race Conditions</h2>\n<p>The user opens user 1, then quickly user 2. Two requests are in flight. If user 1&#39;s answer arrives <strong>after</strong> user 2&#39;s, the page shows user 1 while the URL says user 2.</p>\n<p>The cleanup function fixes it: when <code>userId</code> changes, React runs the cleanup of the previous effect, which <strong>aborts</strong> the old request. Its promise rejects with an <code>AbortError</code>, which we ignore, so only the latest answer reaches the state.</p>\n<p>If an API doesn&#39;t support aborting, use a flag instead:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> ignore </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  loadUser</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(userId).</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">then</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">data</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">!</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">ignore) </span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">setUser</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    ignore </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}, [userId]);</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"a-reusable-hook\">A Reusable Hook</h2>\n<p>You&#39;ll fetch in many components. Move the pattern into a <strong>custom hook</strong>, a function whose name starts with <code>use</code> and calls other hooks:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useFetch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">url</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">setState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">] </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ data: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, error: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, loading: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> controller</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    setState</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">({ data: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, error: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, loading: </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    fetch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(url, { signal: controller.signal })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">then</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">response</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">!</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">response.ok) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#C